<title>PERU: Peru's Buenaventura Q1 net soars.</title>
<headline>Peru's Buenaventura Q1 net soars.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share - N.A.</p>
<p>Net - 63.6 million soles vs 16.9 million soles.</p>
<p>Revs - 43.9 million soles vs 47.7 million soles.</p>
<p>NOTES: Compania de Minas Buenaventura SA is a Peruvian mining firm and a blue chip on the Lima Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>((-- Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
</text>
